<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C, Pass 24 — Yobshrimp creature port.
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Yobshrimp` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair, renamed under the RSW_ tier prefix. New `RSW_YobshrimpLand` BodyDef
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml) — vanilla Shell/Elytra/InsectHeart/Pronotum/
  InsectHead/InsectNostril/InsectMouth/Arm/InsectLeg/Foot parts plus the
  already-ported `RSW_SW_LeftClaw` part and `RSW_SWLeftLegClawAttackTool`/
  `RSW_SWRightLegClawAttackTool` groups (Wave B) — the donor's own body
  reuses `SW_LeftClaw` for BOTH the front-left AND front-right pincer
  (ported byte-identical, a pre-existing donor quirk, not our call to
  "fix"). `leatherDef`/`specificMeatDef` (`Leather_Crustapod`/
  `Crustapod_Meat`) ALREADY EXIST as RSW_ ports (Wave B). New
  `RSW_EggYobshrimpFertilized`/`UnFertilized` eggs (texPath swresource/EggRoe,
  already-extracted shared texture); the unfertilized egg's own
  `tasteThought`/`specialThoughtAsIngredient` (`AteCrustapodRoe`) stays a
  bare donor reference, same precedent as `RSW_Crustapod_Meat`'s own use of
  it (Wave B) — resolves fine while Mlie stays active, no new ThoughtDef.
  All 4 vocal sounds already absorbed (`RSW_Pawn_Yobshrimp_*`).

  No `*ArtOverride` mod exists for Yobshrimp. 13 PNGs extracted this pass:
  `Yobshrimp_{south,east,north}`, `Yobshrimp_Dessicated`, the juvenile
  lifeStage's `Yobshrimp_j_{south,east,north}`, and the swimming variants
  `Yobshrimp_Swimming_{south,east,north}`/`Yobshrimp_j_Swimming_{south,east,
  north}` — all referenced by the donor's own PawnKindDef.

  Real donor-bundle asset gap found and worked around (same class as the
  Igitz juvenile-swimming gap, Pass 10): the donor's own PawnKindDef
  references `swanimals/Yobshrimp/Yobshrimp_j_Dessicated` for the juvenile
  life stage's dessicated corpse, but no such texture exists anywhere in the
  AssetBundle (confirmed via extract_bundle.py's list mode — 6 total
  `Yobshrimp_j*` matches, none named `Yobshrimp_j_Dessicated`).
  `validate_patch.py` caught this as a real error (pink placeholder). Worked
  around by repointing the juvenile `dessicatedBodyGraphicData` to the
  already-extracted adult `Yobshrimp_Dessicated` texPath instead, same fix
  pattern as Igitz.

  YOBSHRIMP_DEFNAME_COLLISION_1 (2026-09-19): this pass's `RSW_Yobshrimp`
  defName collided with the earlier SW_SEA_MONSTERS_ART_1 "pale yobshrimp"
  (SeaBeasts_Swarm.xml, aquatic nursery swarm) — both ThingDef+PawnKindDef
  pairs shared `mandrake.rsw.swbestiary`, so DefDatabase<T>.AddAllInMods()
  silently dropped the second one it enumerated (the aquatic pair, per a
  fresh def dump). This land crustacean's ThingDef/PawnKindDef/BodyDef were
  renamed to `RSW_YobshrimpLand` to free `RSW_Yobshrimp` for the aquatic
  pair, which was never previously reachable in play.
-->
